cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MolScout, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MolScout: Molecules from Chemistry Papers as Canonical SMILES"
abstract: >-
  MolScout turns a chemistry paper's PDF into a table of its molecules, with canonical SMILES,
  compound label, page, box and status for each one, and benchmarks the result against structure
  readers and complete extraction systems on public and private paper sets.
authors:
  - family-names: Obaidullah
    given-names: Muhammad
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/as-obaid/MolScout"
keywords:
  - optical chemical structure recognition
  - cheminformatics
  - document parsing
  - SMILES
  - benchmark
